bob-cli","clan_summary":"[bold #D75FFF]◆ EPIC bob-cli-g1[/bold #D75FFF]\n[dim]  Title: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]Ledger frees marks[/bold #D7AFFF]\n[dim]   Goal: [#D7D7AF][/dim]In today's daily note, each Task Link under an open Pomodoro whose [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]task is the last blocker of other open tasks wears a quiet \"🔑 [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]frees N\" mark. N always matches the task's own BLOCKS row, the [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]hover names the freed tasks, and the mark is verified in real [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]Obsidian.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]3[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202611/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]ledger_frees_marks.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202611/ledger_frees_marks.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]bob-cli-g1[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/bobs-org/bob-cli--beads/blob/main/pages/bob-cli-g1/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Authoritative display contract (bob-cli)[/bold #D7AFFF]                      [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]contract[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]contract: write and register bob-cli docs/frees-marks.md (rule, look, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]placement, tooltip, motion, liveness, FL/FC/FT/FP vectors) and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cross-link BLOCKS §14.9.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]The mark in bob-ledger-tools (bob-plugins)[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]ledger_mark[dim] · [dim][/dim]after contract[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ledger_mark: implement the pure core, Live Preview and Reading mixin, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]CSS, wiring, vector tests with BLOCKS parity, docs inventory, and [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]manifest bump; build, test, sync.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Real-Obsidian e2e and visual review (bob-plugins, bob-cli)[/bold #D7AFFF]    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]live_verify[dim] · [dim][/dim]after ledger_mark[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]live_verify: add an isolated real-Obsidian e2e with light/dark [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]screenshots, tune CSS from the review, and record live verification in [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]the contract.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"bob-cli-g1","llm_provider":"muse","model":"muse-spark-1.3-contributor","patch_name":"gh_bobs-org__bob-cli","phase_bead_id":"bob-cli-g1.1","reasoning_effort":"high","vcs_provider":"GitHub"},"source_run_id":"run-458671de350672463f639a305565fc07","started_at":"2026-11-02T17:47:59.958419+00:00","state":"completed"},{"capabilities":{"durably_revivable":true,"historically_viewable":true,"missing_requirements":["prompt"],"restartable":false},"commits":[],"dismissed_at":null,"files":{"chat":{"digest":"96b0813e0a2c256dbecf72f235073b3ed1da0b32d43b02b1e5eb97f112f51991","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-g1.land--gate/chat.md","size_bytes":560},"commits":{"digest":"b5d1b4f0d1666cb0409fef997fa02160d46a30ac6db332f473cd2bdaf5892b69","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-g1.land--gate/commits.json","size_bytes":89},"meta":{"digest":"166b58292de3ddeed78eae832dbf060a53aa091f998e81dadb3a9b1cef26488c","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-g1.land--gate/meta.json","size_bytes":737},"state":{"digest":"7c51a6770fb08cbd26263726433d856a032bf84a37f08295d291b8c2e1363b0f","path":"agents/bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-g1.land--gate/state.json","size_bytes":213}},"finished_at":"2026-11-02T20:44:18.787594+00:00","global_name":"bbugyi200.athena.bob-cli-g1.land--gate","local_name":"bob-cli-g1.land--gate","metadata":{"agent_clan":"bob-cli-g1","